            "contentType": "STORY",
            "title": "Nukkleus completes Tiltan acquisition",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "Nukkleus (NUKK) announced the closing of its acquisition of Tiltan Software Engineering. Tiltan is now a wholly owned subsidiary of the Company. The company said, \u201cTiltan\u2019s technology is embedded in some of the world\u2019s most advanced defense programs. Tiltan\u2019s simulation platforms train pilots and operators for Israel Aerospace Industries, its synthetic data accelerates machine learning development for Elbit Systems, and its GPS-denied navigation systems enable Rafael Advanced Defense Systems pla",
